<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@type":"NewsArticle","headline":"DEM Parti'nin Hakkari ve Batman adaylar\u0131 belli oldu","articleSection":"Politika","dateCreated":"2024-01-14T21:05:00+03:00","datePublished":"2024-01-14T21:05:00+03:00","dateModified":"2024-01-14T22:26:27+03:00","wordCount":405,"genre":"news","mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https:\/\/www.elipshaber.com\/dem-partinin-hakkari-ve-batman-adaylari-belli-oldu"},"articleBody":"Halklar\u0131n E\u015fitlik ve Demokrasi Partisi (DEM Parti), Hakkari ve Batman'da da adaylar\u0131n\u0131 binlerce delegenin oy kulland\u0131\u011f\u0131 \u00f6n se\u00e7imle belirledi.&nbsp; Hakkari\u2019deki oylamada Mehmet S\u0131dd\u0131k Ak\u0131\u015f ile Viyan Tek\u00e7e DEM Parti'nin HakkAri Belediye e\u015f ba\u015fkan adaylar\u0131 olarak belirlendi. Aday adaylar\u0131 sahneye \u00e7\u0131karak \u00f6nse\u00e7imi kazanan se\u00e7ilen Viyan Tek\u00e7e ile Mehmet S\u0131dd\u0131k Ak\u0131\u015f'\u0131 tebrik etti.\r\n\r\nSahnede k\u0131sa bir a\u00e7\u0131klama yapan eski Hakk\u00e2ri Belediye Ba\u015fkan\u0131 \u015e\u00fckr\u00fc \u00c7all\u0131 \"Netice demokrasi ile ta\u00e7land\u0131. Bug\u00fcn 16 oy farkla S\u0131dd\u0131k Ak\u0131\u015f arkada\u015f\u0131m\u0131z se\u00e7ilmi\u015ftir. Bu iradeye sayg\u0131 duyuyorum. Onu tebrik ediyorum. Baz\u0131lar \u015e\u00fckr\u00fc \u00c7all\u0131'n\u0131n ba\u015fka partiye ge\u00e7ece\u011fini konu\u015fuyor. \u015e\u00fckr\u00fc \u00c7all\u0131 kendini ispatlam\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\" dedi. Kad\u0131n e\u015f ba\u015fkan adaylar\u0131ndan Sinem Seven ise \u201cHalk ve delegasyonumuz tercihini S\u0131dd\u0131k Ak\u0131\u015f ve Viyan Tek\u00e7e\u2019 den yana kulland\u0131 biz de bu iradeye sayg\u0131 duyuyoruz. Yol arkada\u015flar\u0131m\u0131z\u0131 tebrik ediyoruz.\" \u015feklinde konu\u015ftu. Belediye e\u015f ba\u015fkan adayl\u0131\u011f\u0131na se\u00e7ilen Viyan Tek\u00e7e de Hakk\u00e2ri halk\u0131n\u0131n tevecc\u00fch\u00fcn\u00fc kazanmas\u0131ndan duydu\u011fu memnuniyeti dile getirerek t\u00fcm delegelere te\u015fekk\u00fcr etti.\r\n\r\nBatman \u2018da G\u00fclistan S\u00f6n\u00fck ve Mehdi \u00d6zt\u00fcz\u00fcn\r\n\r\nDEM Parti'nin Batman'daki \u00f6n se\u00e7iminde ise 4 bin delege oy kulland\u0131.&nbsp;\u00d6n se\u00e7imi 1361 oy alan G\u00fclistan S\u00f6n\u00fck ile 1753 oy alan&nbsp;Mehdi \u00d6zt\u00fcz\u00fcn kazand\u0131. G\u00fclistan S\u00f6n\u00fck, 1993 y\u0131l\u0131nda Kozluk'ta do\u011fdu. 2018 y\u0131l\u0131nda Siyaset bilimi ve uluslararas\u0131 ili\u015fkiler b\u00f6l\u00fcm\u00fcnden mezun oldu. \u00d6\u011frencilik y\u0131llar\u0131nda partinin gen\u00e7lik \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmalar\u0131nda aktif olarak yer ald\u0131. 2019 yerel se\u00e7imlerinde Bekirhan Belediyesi e\u015fba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131na se\u00e7ildi. 2020 y\u0131l\u0131ndan beri Batman'da kad\u0131n \u00f6zg\u00fcn \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmalar\u0131nda yer ald\u0131. Son bir bu\u00e7uk y\u0131ld\u0131r K\u00fcrt illerinde ve T\u00fcrkiye'nin bir \u00e7ok ilinde kad\u0131n \u00f6zg\u00fcn \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmalar y\u00fcr\u00fct\u00fcyor.\r\n\r\nAvukat Mehdi \u00d6zt\u00fcz\u00fcn ise 1964 y\u0131l\u0131nda Batman\u2019da do\u011fdu. Dicle \u00dcniversitesi Hukuk Fak\u00fcltesi mezunu. 2003 y\u0131l\u0131nda DEHAP y\u00f6netimi ile ba\u015flad\u0131\u011f\u0131 siyasi kariyerine bir s\u00fcre DEHAP Batman \u0130l Ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve \u0130mral\u0131 g\u00f6r\u00fc\u015fmeleriyle devam etti. 30 y\u0131ll\u0131k hukuk\u00e7u kimli\u011finin yan\u0131 s\u0131ra Batman Belediyespor Kul\u00fcp Ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131 g\u00f6revlerinde&nbsp;de&nbsp;bulundu.\r\n\r\n","description":"DEM Parti'nin yapt\u0131\u011f\u0131 \u00f6n se\u00e7im sonu\u00e7lar\u0131na g\u00f6re Hakkari ve Batman\u2019da adaylar belli oldu. Hakk\u00e2ri'de sand\u0131ktan Mehmet S\u0131dd\u0131k Ak\u0131\u015f ve Viyan Tek\u00e7e, Batman'da\u2026","inLanguage":"tr-TR","keywords":["DEM Parti","yerel se\u00e7im","aday","belediye ba\u015fkan aday\u0131","Hakkari","batman","S\u0131dd\u0131k Ak\u0131\u015f","Viyan Tek\u00e7e","G\u00fclistan S\u00f6n\u00fck","Mehdi \u00d6zt\u00fct\u00fcn"],"image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https:\/\/elipshabercom.teimg.com\/crop\/1280x720\/elipshaber-com\/uploads\/2024\/01\/dem-parti-3.JPG","width":"1280","height":"720","caption":"DEM Parti'nin Hakkari ve Batman adaylar\u0131 belli oldu"},"publishingPrinciples":"https:\/\/www.elipshaber.com\/hakkinda#yayin-ilkeleri-ve-haber-dogrulama-politikasi","isFamilyFriendly":"http:\/\/schema.org\/True","isAccessibleForFree":"http:\/\/schema.org\/True","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","@id":"https:\/\/www.elipshaber.com\/#organization","name":"Elips Haber","image":"https:\/\/elipshabercom.teimg.com\/elipshaber-com\/uploads\/2023\/10\/elips-haber-logo-220x40-op.png","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https:\/\/elipshabercom.teimg.com\/elipshaber-com\/uploads\/2023\/10\/elips-haber-logo-220x40-op.png","width":"640","height":"375"}},"author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Haber Merkezi","url":"https:\/\/www.elipshaber.com"},"editor":{"@type":"Person","name":"S\u00fcmeyye Aksu","url":"https:\/\/www.elipshaber.com\/muhabir\/17\/sumeyye-aksu"},"creator":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","@id":"https:\/\/www.elipshaber.com\/#organization","name":"Elips Haber","url":"https:\/\/www.elipshaber.com"}}</script>


